"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122135021751359074%20-%20%0A%09Yesterday%2C%20we%20had%20the%20opportunity%20to%20take%20part%20in%20the%20Benton%20County%20Board%20Cookout%2C%20where%20we%20helped%20prepare%20and%20serve%20lunch%20for%20the%20hardworking%20employees%20of%20Benton%20County.We%E2%80%99re%20incredibly%20thankful%20for%20the%20men%20and%20women%20who%20show%20up%20every%20day%20to%20serve%20our%20communities%20and%20keep%20county%20services%20running.%20Their%20hard%20work%2C%20dedication%2C%20and%20commitment%20often%20happen%20behind%20the%20scenes%2C%20but%20they%20make%20a%20real%20difference%20in%20the%20lives%20of%20the%20people%20they%20serve.Thank%20you%20to%20all%20of%20our%20Benton%20County%20employees%20for%20everything%20you%20do.%20We%20appreciate%20you%20and%20the%20important%20role%20you%20play%20in%20making%20our%20county%20a%20great%20place%20to%20live%2C%20work%2C%20and%20raise%20a%20family%21%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122135650257359074%20-%20%0A%09Recent%20reports%20of%20threats%20surrounding%20local%20sporting%20events%20are%20deeply%20concerning.%20Our%20schools%20and%20athletic%20events%20should%20be%20places%20where%20students%2C%20families%2C%20and%20communities%20can%20come%20together%20without%20fear%20for%20their%20safety.My%20thoughts%20and%20prayers%20are%20with%20our%20students%2C%20families%2C%20coaches%2C%20and%20everyone%20affected%20by%20these%20concerns.I%20also%20want%20to%20express%20my%20sincere%20appreciation%20for%20our%20local%20law%20enforcement%20officers%20who%20work%20every%20day%20to%20keep%20our%20communities%20safe.%20Their%20dedication%2C%20professionalism%2C%20and%20willingness%20to%20put%20themselves%20in%20harm%E2%80%99s%20way%20do%20not%20go%20unnoticed.Thank%20you%20to%20all%20who%20work%20to%20protect%20our%20communities.%20Please%20stay%20safe%2C%20look%20out%20for%20one%20another%2C%20and%20keep%20everyone%20affected%20in%20your%20prayers.%20%09%0A%09"
},
