"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122135857395359074%20-%20%0A%09Fraud%20is%20stealing%20from%20Minnesota%20taxpayers%2C%20and%20we%20need%20to%20hold%20those%20responsible%20accountable.We%20also%20need%20to%20make%20sure%20the%20people%20who%20truly%20need%20a%20hand%20up%20are%20the%20ones%20receiving%20it.My%20work%20as%20a%20Benton%20County%20Commissioner%20has%20given%20me%20an%20in-depth%20look%20at%20the%20outdated%20technology%20used%20at%20the%20state%20level%20to%20administer%20these%20programs.%20These%20antiquated%20systems%20not%20only%20create%20unnecessary%20work%20and%20delays%20for%20employees%20entering%20data%2C%20but%20they%20also%20lack%20the%20checks%20and%20balances%20needed%20to%20help%20prevent%20fraud.In%20a%20time%20when%20so%20much%20information%20is%20available%20at%20our%20fingertips%20and%20Minnesotans%20expect%20government%20to%20work%20efficiently%2C%20our%20state%20systems%20need%20to%20catch%20up.We%20need%20modern%20technology%2C%20stronger%20safeguards%2C%20and%20greater%20accountability%20to%20protect%20taxpayer%20dollars%20while%20making%20sure%20assistance%20reaches%20the%20people%20it%20is%20intended%20to%20serve.www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23mnleg%20%23MNSenate%20%23District13%20%23MNFraud%20%23MNPolitics%20%23Vote2026%20%23mnvotes%20%23GOP%20%23gapinskiformnsenate%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122136208941359074%20-%20%0A%09This%20past%20Thursday%2C%20I%20had%20the%20opportunity%20to%20speak%20at%20another%20important%20forum.%20This%20event%20was%20hosted%20by%20the%20Minnesota%20Transportation%20Alliance.It%20was%20a%20great%20opportunity%20to%20answer%20questions%20and%20have%20meaningful%20conversations%20about%20transportation%20funding%20at%20both%20the%20local%20and%20state%20levels.The%20discussion%20covered%20several%20important%20topics%2C%20including%20where%20transportation%20funding%20comes%20from%2C%20what%20factors%20impact%20road%20and%20infrastructure%20projects%2C%20wetland%20replacement%20challenges%2C%20and%20more.It%E2%80%99s%20always%20valuable%20to%20hear%20directly%20from%20county%20engineers%20and%20MnDOT%20representatives%20who%20work%20with%20these%20issues%20firsthand.Thank%20you%20to%20the%20Minnesota%20Transportation%20Alliance%20for%20hosting%20and%20to%20everyone%20who%20participated%20in%20the%20conversation%21www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg%20%23MNSenate%20%23District13%20%23MNPolitics%20%23Vote2026%20%23MNVotes%20%23GOP%20%23GapinskiforMNSenate%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122136899049359074%20-%20%0A%09A%20little%20friendly%20competition%20and%20some%20great%20chili%20sounds%20like%20a%20perfect%20Sunday%20afternoon%21I%E2%80%99m%20looking%20forward%20to%20joining%20Tanja%20Goering%20as%20a%20guest%20judge%20for%20the%20Watkins%20Lions%20Club%E2%80%99s%20First%20Annual%20Chili%20Cook-Off%21Come%20on%20out%20to%20The%20Store%20Saloon%20in%20St.%20Nick%20this%20Sunday%2C%20October%2018th%2C%20from%201%E2%80%933%20PM%20for%20some%20delicious%20chili%2C%20good%20company%2C%20and%20community%20fun%21Hope%20to%20see%20you%20there%21%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%B8THIS%20SUNDAY%21%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8FGet%20ready%20for%20the%20First%20Annual%20Chili%20Cook-Off%20at%20the%20Store%20Saloon%21%20Whether%20you%27re%20a%20chili%20recipe%20master%20or%20you%20just%20love%20to%20eat%20the%20stuff%2C%20come%20on%20out%20this%20Sunday%20starting%20at%201%20for%20Sunday%20Funday%20with%20Mike%2C%20Rose%20and%20us.%20There%27s%20loads%20of%20fun%20things%20going%20on%20all%20day.%20%28See%20comments%20below%20for%20chili%20cook-off%20rules%21%29%F0%9F%93%8D%20The%20Vikes%20don%27t%20play%2C%20but%20other%20games%20will%20be%20shown%20starting%20at%20noon.%F0%9F%93%8D%20Chili%20sampling%20begins%20at%201pm.%F0%9F%93%8D%20Judging%20will%20be%20complete%20at%203pm%20-%20we%20need%20your%20help%20with%20this%21%20%F0%9F%93%8D%20Speaking%20of%20judging%2C%20we%20will%20have%20some%20sweet%20guest%20judges%20joining%20us%20-%20Tanja%20Goering%20for%20MN%20and%20Jared%20Gapinski%20For%20MN%20Senate%2013%21%F0%9F%93%8D%20Starting%20at%203pm%2C%20the%20Lions%20will%20be%20slinging%20meat%20raffle%20meat%20plus%20we%27ll%20be%20running%20horse%20races%20for%20BIG%20CASH%20and%20%245%20tip%20boards%20for%20%2425%20and%20%2490%20prizes%20every%20round.To%20sign%20up%20to%20participate%20in%20the%20Chili%20Cook-Off%2C%20please%20text%20Jenny%20at%20320-223-3602.%20Entry%20fee%20is%20%2410.And%20honestly%2C%20if%20you%20have%20not%20yet%20become%20a%20massive%20fan%20of%20the%20hand-crafted%20cocktails%20that%20Mike%20and%20Rose%20have%20made%20famous%2C%20one%20sip%20and%20you%27ll%20be%20HOOKED.%20Old%20Fashioneds%2C%20Bee%27s%20Knees%20and%20more%2C%20handcrafted%20right%20in%20front%20of%20you.%20We%27ll%20see%20you%20Sunday.%20%20%09%0A%09"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook#038;body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1181125958415891_122136902763359074%20-%20%0A%09What%20a%20great%20day%20at%20the%20Sauk%20Rapids%20Fire%20Department%20Open%20House%20this%20past%20Saturday%21%20%F0%9F%9A%92%F0%9F%8D%82This%20event%20is%20always%20a%20special%20one%20for%20me.%20I%20spent%20nearly%2020%20years%20serving%20with%20the%20Sauk%20Rapids%20Fire%20Department%20as%20a%20firefighter%20and%20captain%2C%20and%20it%20was%20great%20to%20be%20back%20catching%20up%20with%20old%20friends%20and%20fellow%20firefighters%21We%20couldn%E2%80%99t%20have%20asked%20for%20better%20weather%2C%20and%20the%20turnout%20was%20incredible%21%20From%20the%20free%20pumpkins%20and%20vehicle%20extrication%20demonstrations%20to%20the%20kids%20getting%20to%20climb%20inside%20the%20fire%20trucks%20and%20explore%20all%20the%20equipment%2C%20there%20was%20something%20for%20everyone%20to%20enjoy.Having%20spent%20so%20many%20years%20in%20the%20fire%20service%2C%20I%20know%20firsthand%20the%20time%2C%20dedication%2C%20and%20sacrifice%20that%20go%20into%20protecting%20our%20communities.%20It%E2%80%99s%20wonderful%20to%20see%20so%20many%20families%20come%20out%20to%20support%20these%20men%20and%20women%20and%20learn%20more%20about%20what%20they%20do.A%20huge%20thank%20you%20to%20the%20Sauk%20Rapids%20Fire%20Department%20and%20everyone%20who%20helped%20put%20on%20another%20fantastic%20open%20house.%20I%E2%80%99m%20proud%20to%20have%20been%20part%20of%20this%20department%20and%20will%20always%20appreciate%20the%20people%20who%20continue%20to%20serve%20our%20community%21%20%F0%9F%87%BA%F0%9F%87%B8%F0%9F%9A%92www.gapinskiformnsenate.com%23MNLeg%20%23MNSenate%20%23District13%20%23FirstResponders%20%23SaukRapidsMN%20%23Community%20%23MNPolitics%20%23Vote2026%20%23MNVotes%20%23GOP%20%23GapinskiforMNSenate%20%09%0A%09"
},
